 ⍙R←⍙GitRemote ⍙RA;⍙ARG;⍙C;⍙I;⍙N;⍙PDIR;⍙TEMP;⍙TYP;⍙U
⍝ Manage the list of remote git branches maintained.

⍝ Syntaxes:
⍝ ⍙R←⍙GitRemote '' - Show current list of remote branches

⍝ ⍙R←⍙GitRemote 'Add <Alias> <URL>' ⍙TEMP - Add a remote URL

⍝ ⍙R←⍙GitRemote 'Remove <Alias>' ⍙TEMP - Remove a remote URL

⍝ ⍙R←⍙GitRemote 'Rename <OldAlias> <NewAlias>' ⍙TEMP
⍝   - Rename a remote branch (for your list of remote's only)

⍝ Requires: ⍙COMMAND

⍝ Parse ⍙RA:
⍝ 1⊃ Call name and params (e.g. 'Add MyRepo github.com/myname/myrepo')
⍝ 2⊃ Temp dir for ⍙COMMAND
⍝ 3⊃ WS's parent directory (must contain .git hidden folder from init/clone)
 (⍙ARG ⍙TEMP ⍙PDIR)←⍙RA

⍝ Parse call type from ⍙ARG (and delete trailing blanks):
:if 0<⍴⍙TYP←⍙ARG ⋄ ⍙I←⍙TYP⍳' '
   ⍙TYP←(¯1+⍙I)↑⍙ARG ⋄ ⍙ARG←⍙I↓⍙ARG
   ⍙ARG←(⌽~^\⌽' '=⍙ARG)/⍙ARG ⍝ Delete trailing blanks
   ⍙TYP←⎕WCALL 'CharUpper' ⍙TYP ⍝ Case insensitive call type
:endif

:SELECT ⍙TYP
:CASE '' ⍝ Show list of managed remote branches:
   ⍙C←'git remote -v' ⍝ -v: verbose (with url)
:CASE 'ADD' ⍝ Add a remote branch to the list of managed branches:
  ⍝ Split what is left of ⍙ARG into the <Alias> and <URL>:
   ⍙I←⍙ARG⍳' ' ⋄ ⍙N←(¯1+⍙I)↑⍙ARG ⋄ ⍙U←⍙I↓⍙ARG
  :If 0∊⎕ENLIST ⍴¨⍙U,⍙N ⍝ Return an error message if missing alias or URL
     ⍙R←'Bad argument; Argument should look like: "Add <Alias> <URL>"'
     →0
  :EndIf
   ⍙C←'git remote add ',⍙N,' ',⍙U
:CASE 'REMOVE' ⍝ Remove a branch from the list of remotely managed repos
   ⍙C←'git remote remove ',⍙ARG
:CASE 'RENAME' ⍝ Rename a remotely managed branch (locally)
  ⍝ Split what is left of ⍙ARG into the <OldAlias> and <NewAlias>:
   ⍙I←⍙ARG⍳' ' ⋄ ⍙U←(¯1+⍙I)↑⍙ARG ⋄ ⍙N←⍙I↓⍙ARG
  :If 0∊⍴¨⍙U,⍙N ⍝ Return an error message if missing alias or URL
     ⍙R←'Bad argument; Argument should look like: "Rename <OldAlias> <NewAlias>"'
     →0
  :EndIf
   ⍙C←'git remote rename ',⍙U,' ',⍙N
:ENDSELECT
 ⍙R←⍙TEMP ⍙COMMAND ⍙PDIR ⍙C ⍝ Execute the specified git command
⍝ Deal with horrendous ⎕TCLF placement:
:if 0<⍴⍙R ⋄ ⍙R←⊃((1,1↓⎕TCLF=⍙R)⎕PENCLOSE ⍙R)~¨⎕TCLF ⋄ :endif